# `Selection-criterion surfaces for issue 1138 B12, plan 12 leaf 15 (#901).`
# `A technical contradiction is between two criteria, and the point on the`
# `0-1 range is counted from the requirement's own clauses: each clause that`
# `demands a criterion is one vote for it. The surfaces that make such a`
# `demand recognisable live here, in seed data, so`
# `src/selection_heuristics/triz.rs names only the two language-independent`
# `roles below and no spelling appears in Rust.`
# `The forms are stems, read through mentions_role_raw, because a demand is`
# `inflected in every language the corpus covers: "shortest"/"short",`
# `"короткий"/"короче", "छोटा", "最短", "corta"/"corto".`
meanings
  selection_criterion_brevity
    defined-by concept
    role selection_criterion_brevity_cue
    lexeme en "shortest" "shorter" "short" "concise" "brief" "terse"
    lexeme ru "корот" "кратк" "сжат" "лаконич"
    lexeme hi "छोट" "संक्षिप्त" "संक्षेप"
    lexeme zh "最短" "简短" "简洁" "精简"
    lexeme es "corta" "corto" "breve" "conciso" "concisa"
  selection_criterion_completeness
    defined-by concept
    role selection_criterion_completeness_cue
    lexeme en "complete" "completeness" "cover" "covers" "exhaustive" "every case" "all cases"
    lexeme ru "полнот" "полност" "покрыва" "охватыва" "исчерпыва"
    lexeme hi "पूर्ण" "कवर" "समग्र" "हर मामले"
    lexeme zh "完整" "覆盖" "全面" "详尽"
    lexeme es "exhaustiv" "complet" "cubra" "cubre" "cubrir" "todos los casos"
